/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 43 0 R
/T (All data in this report is derived from observable user behaviour within the Reaction platform and from an optional in-app belonging survey. Self-reported belonging scores use a Likert 1-5 agree/disagree scale mirroring NSS Optional Bank B2.1 \("The Students' Union had a positive impact on my sense of belonging"\). This is not an official NSS score. The control group comprises students who registered but did not actively use the platform \(fewer than 2 sessions\). Engagement metrics \(active, declining\) refer to platform activity only and should not be interpreted as academic continuation or progression measures without cross-referencing institutional data.)
/E (All data in this report is derived from observable user behaviour within the Reaction platform and from an optional in-app belonging survey. Self-reported belonging scores use a Likert 1-5 agree/disagree scale mirroring NSS Optional Bank B2.1 \("The Students' Union had a positive impact on my sense of belonging"\). This is not an official NSS score. The control group comprises students who registered but did not actively use the platform \(fewer than 2 sessions\). Engagement metrics \(active, declining\) refer to platform activity only and should not be interpreted as academic continuation or progression measures without cross-referencing institutional data.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
