/T (TEF Student Experience aspect - evidence of structured peer engagement, co-curricular activity, and student community development beyond formal teaching provision. NSS Theme: Student Voice \(Q22-Q25\) and Optional Bank B2.1 - self-reported belonging scores from Reaction users compared with a non-user control group, measured using an equivalent Likert 1-5 agree/disagree scale. OfS Access and Participation Plan - participation rates disaggregated by student origin, year of study, and commuter/campus residence status, with cross-group interaction metrics.)
/E (TEF Student Experience aspect - evidence of structured peer engagement, co-curricular activity, and student community development beyond formal teaching provision. NSS Theme: Student Voice \(Q22-Q25\) and Optional Bank B2.1 - self-reported belonging scores from Reaction users compared with a non-user control group, measured using an equivalent Likert 1-5 agree/disagree scale. OfS Access and Participation Plan - participation rates disaggregated by student origin, year of study, and commuter/campus residence status, with cross-group interaction metrics.)
