/T (Highest single-month engagement: January 2026 \(312 active users, 274 sessions, 183 new connections\). This coincides with the start of Semester 2, suggesting the platform serves as a re-engagement tool after the Christmas break. Wednesday afternoons \(BUCS sport slot\) and Sunday evenings are the peak posting times, indicating the platform complements rather than competes with formal AU club provision.)
