/T (Self-selection bias: Students who choose to use a peer engagement platform may differ systematically from non-users in ways that affect belonging scores. Belonging measure: The in-app survey is not equivalent to the official NSS instrument. It provides supplementary evidence only and should not be cited as an NSS score. Engagement metrics: "Active" and "declining" classifications relate to platform use only and are not indicators of academic engagement, continuation, or wellbeing. Demographic data: Student origin and commuter status are self-reported at registration and have not been validated against)
/E (Self-selection bias: Students who choose to use a peer engagement platform may differ systematically from non-users in ways that affect belonging scores. Belonging measure: The in-app survey is not equivalent to the official NSS instrument. It provides supplementary evidence only and should not be cited as an NSS score. Engagement metrics: "Active" and "declining" classifications relate to platform use only and are not indicators of academic engagement, continuation, or wellbeing. Demographic data: Student origin and commuter status are self-reported at registration and have not been validated against)
